{"seq":2,"slug":"waves-tides","title":"波浪与潮汐","url":"/l-doc-books/h/geography-geopolitics/oceanography/dynamics/waves-tides","wordCount":1812,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"波浪与潮汐\">波浪与潮汐</h1><p>站在海边，最直观的海洋运动是两种：一秒接一秒拍岸的波浪，和半天一轮、悄然吞没沙滩又退去的潮汐。它们看似都是&quot;水的起伏&quot;，物理本质却完全不同——波浪是风把能量交给海面、以重力为恢复力的扰动；潮汐是日月引力对整个海洋的周期性拉扯。中间还潜伏着一类罕见而致命的波：海啸。本篇讲这三类&quot;周期性海面运动&quot;的力学：波浪如何生成、传播、破碎，海啸为何在深海无形却在岸边致命，潮汐如何由天体引力精确驱动。它与<a href=\"currents-circulation\">海流与环流</a>的区别在于：那里讲水的净输运，这里讲水的振荡。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三类波的对比\">核心概念：三类波的对比</h2><p>水面波按波长（相邻波峰间距）跨越巨大尺度，从厘米级的涟漪到行星尺度的潮波，恢复力与传播规律各异。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>波长</th>\n<th>周期</th>\n<th>主要恢复力</th>\n<th>成因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>风浪/涌浪</td>\n<td>米到百米</td>\n<td>1–25 s</td>\n<td>重力</td>\n<td>风的能量输入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>海啸</td>\n<td>100–500 km</td>\n<td>10 分钟–2 小时</td>\n<td>重力</td>\n<td>海底地震、滑坡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>潮汐</td>\n<td>数千 km（半个地球）</td>\n<td>12.4 或 24.8 小时</td>\n<td>重力</td>\n<td>日月引潮力</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[能量来源] --&gt; B[风 -&gt; 风浪涌浪]&#10;  A --&gt; C[海底地震 -&gt; 海啸]&#10;  A --&gt; D[日月引力 -&gt; 潮汐]&#10;  B --&gt; E[深水波 传播速度由波长定]&#10;  C --&gt; F[浅水波 速度由水深定]&#10;  D --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[近岸变浅 波速降 波高增]&#10;  E --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H[破碎或淹没海岸]\">flowchart TD\n  A[能量来源] --&gt; B[风 -&gt; 风浪涌浪]\n  A --&gt; C[海底地震 -&gt; 海啸]\n  A --&gt; D[日月引力 -&gt; 潮汐]\n  B --&gt; E[深水波 传播速度由波长定]\n  C --&gt; F[浅水波 速度由水深定]\n  D --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[近岸变浅 波速降 波高增]\n  E --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H[破碎或淹没海岸]</pre><h2 id=\"风浪的力学\">风浪的力学</h2><p>风把能量传给海面，先激起小涟漪，涟漪增大风的抓附面后能量传递更高效，波浪不断成长。波高最终取决于三要素：<strong>风速、风时（吹多久）、风区（吹过多长海面）</strong>。当波浪传出风区，规则平滑的&quot;涌浪&quot;可横越大洋。</p>\n<p>水深与波长的比例决定波的行为，区分深水波与浅水波。深水波（水深 &gt; 半波长）的相速度只由波长决定：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mi>g</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>L</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c = \\sqrt{\\frac{g\\,L}{2\\pi}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.44em;vertical-align:-0.769em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.671em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-4.4em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.631em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:2.48em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"2.48em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 2592\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M424,2478\nc-1.3,-0.7,-38.5,-172,-111.5,-514c-73,-342,-109.8,-513.3,-110.5,-514\nc0,-2,-10.7,14.3,-32,49c-4.7,7.3,-9.8,15.7,-15.5,25c-5.7,9.3,-9.8,16,-12.5,20\ns-5,7,-5,7c-4,-3.3,-8.3,-7.7,-13,-13s-13,-13,-13,-13s76,-122,76,-122s77,-121,77,-121\ns209,968,209,968c0,-2,84.7,-361.7,254,-1079c169.3,-717.3,254.7,-1077.7,256,-1081\nl0 -0c4,-6.7,10,-10,18,-10 H400000\nv40H1014.6\ns-87.3,378.7,-272.6,1166c-185.3,787.3,-279.3,1182.3,-282,1185\nc-2,6,-10,9,-24,9\nc-8,0,-12,-0.7,-12,-2z M1001 80\nh400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span> 为重力加速度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 为波长——长波跑得快，这就是为何远方风暴的长周期涌浪先于风暴本身抵达海岸。深水中水分子近似做闭合圆周运动，水本身并不随波远行，只有能量在传播。当波进入浅水（水深 &lt; 1/20 波长），速度改由水深决定，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c=\\sqrt{gh}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.205em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.835em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.795em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.205em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，波速减慢、波长压缩、波高抬升，最终前倾破碎，把能量倾泻到海岸，塑造海滩、推动沿岸输沙。</p>\n<h2 id=\"海啸-深海无形的浅水波\">海啸：深海无形的浅水波</h2><p>海啸由海底地壳的猛烈错动激发，其震源常是<a href=\"../foundations/seafloor-plates\">海底地形与板块</a>中讲的俯冲带逆冲地震。它有两个反直觉的特性：</p>\n<p>其一，海啸波长达数百公里，远大于大洋水深（几千米），因此<strong>自始至终都是浅水波</strong>，速度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c=\\sqrt{gh}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.205em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.835em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.795em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.205em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 在深海高达每小时 700–800 公里，与喷气客机相当，可横越太平洋。其二，在深海它的波高仅几十厘米，船只浑然不觉；但抵近海岸水深骤减，按能量守恒波速降、波能压缩进更短更浅的水体，波高可暴涨到十几米。2011 年日本东北地震海啸、2004 年印度洋海啸都遵循这一规律，后者因缺乏预警系统致约 23 万人遇难，此后环印度洋建起了海啸预警网。海啸预警正是利用深海波速快于沿岸破坏的时间差争取疏散窗口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"潮汐-日月的引力时钟\">潮汐：日月的引力时钟</h2><p>潮汐是整个海洋对日月引力的响应。月球对地球各处的引力不均：朝月一侧引力强于地心，背月一侧弱于地心，两侧海水都被&quot;甩&quot;出而隆起，形成两个潮汐隆起。地球自转使任一地点每天穿过这两个隆起，于是多数海岸每约 12 小时 25 分经历一次高潮，即<strong>半日潮</strong>。</p>\n<p>太阳的引潮力约为月球的 46%。当日、地、月成一线（朔望），两者引潮力叠加，潮差最大，称<strong>大潮</strong>；当日月成直角（上下弦），引潮力部分抵消，潮差最小，称<strong>小潮</strong>。引潮力本质是引力随距离的差异（梯度），可近似为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mtext>潮</mtext></msub><mo>∝</mo><mfrac><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_{\\text{潮}} \\propto \\frac{M}{d^3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">潮</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 为天体质量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 为到地球的距离——正因为是三次方反比，较近的月球虽质量远小于太阳，引潮作用却更强。实际潮汐还受海盆形状、科里奥利力与共振强烈调制：芬迪湾因共振潮差达 16 米，地中海则几乎无潮。潮汐的可预测能量正被开发为潮汐能，见<a href=\"../human/resources-fisheries\">海洋资源与渔业</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"内波与异常巨浪\">内波与异常巨浪</h2><p>海面之下还有&quot;看不见的波&quot;。在密度分层的界面（如温跃层，见<a href=\"../foundations/physical-properties\">海洋的物理性质</a>）上，潮流越过海底地形可激发<strong>内波</strong>，振幅可达上百米，对潜艇与海洋平台是真实威胁，也通过混合把深层营养盐带向真光层，影响<a href=\"../ecology/productivity-foodweb\">海洋生产力与食物网</a>。海面则偶发<strong>异常巨浪</strong>（rogue wave）——孤立的、远超周边波高两倍以上的怪波，由波列的非线性聚焦与洋流-波浪相互作用造成，曾击伤大型船舶，卫星与浮标观测正逐步揭示其频率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"风暴潮-被风顶高的海面\">风暴潮：被风顶高的海面</h2><p>与上述三类波都不同，<strong>风暴潮</strong>不是周期波，而是台风或强风暴把海水&quot;堆&quot;向海岸造成的异常水位抬升，主要由两股力量叠加：强风的风应力把表层水推向岸边壅高，以及风暴中心低气压像吸管一样把海面&quot;吸&quot;起（气压每降 1 百帕，海面约升 1 厘米）。当风暴潮恰逢天文大潮的高潮，水位叠加可酿成毁灭性海岸淹没——孟加拉湾、墨西哥湾沿岸的历史巨灾多源于此。</p>\n<p>风暴潮的危害正随两个趋势放大：一是<a href=\"../human/climate-ocean\">气候变化与海洋</a>中讲的海平面上升抬高了基准水位，使同等强度的风暴潮淹得更远；二是变暖海洋为台风提供更多潜热燃料（机理见<a href=\"air-sea-interaction\">海气相互作用</a>），使强台风更强。因此风暴潮预报必须把天文潮、风暴潮与长期海平面上升三者叠加考虑，是海岸防灾的核心。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>风浪、海啸、潮汐三类周期运动恢复力均为重力，但成因与尺度迥异，区别于环流的净输运。</li>\n<li>风暴潮是风与低压把海水堆向海岸的非周期性水位抬升，遇大潮高潮则成灾，并因海平面上升与强台风加剧而放大。</li>\n<li>深水波速由波长决定（长波快，故涌浪先到），浅水波速由水深决定；近岸变浅使波高抬升、破碎塑岸。</li>\n<li>海啸波长远大于水深，全程是浅水波，深海时速近 800 km 却仅几十厘米高，近岸暴涨成灾，预警靠速度差争取时间。</li>\n<li>潮汐由日月引潮力（与质量成正比、与距离三次方成反比）驱动，朔望成大潮、弦时成小潮，受海盆共振强烈调制。</li>\n<li>分层界面上的内波可达百米振幅并促进营养上混；海面非线性聚焦产生罕见的异常巨浪。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"波浪与潮汐","id":"波浪与潮汐"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三类波的对比","id":"核心概念-三类波的对比"},{"level":2,"text":"风浪的力学","id":"风浪的力学"},{"level":2,"text":"海啸：深海无形的浅水波","id":"海啸-深海无形的浅水波"},{"level":2,"text":"潮汐：日月的引力时钟","id":"潮汐-日月的引力时钟"},{"level":2,"text":"内波与异常巨浪","id":"内波与异常巨浪"},{"level":2,"text":"风暴潮：被风顶高的海面","id":"风暴潮-被风顶高的海面"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"海流与环流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/geography-geopolitics/oceanography/dynamics/currents-circulation"},"next":{"title":"海气相互作用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/geography-geopolitics/oceanography/dynamics/air-sea-interaction"}}